1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:03,019
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Aileen was woken up by her alarm.

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:06,520
She did not want to wake up, but

3
00:00:06,520 --> 00:00:07,760
she had to.

4
00:00:08,360 --> 00:00:11,120
She had a test at 8 a.m.

5
00:00:12,060 --> 00:00:14,500
Washing her face helped a lot.

6
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,880
She went to the bathroom.

7
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:20,100
She did not want to use the cold

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:23,840
water, but cold water wakes her up.

9
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:27,560
Warm water does not make her more awake.

10
00:00:28,460 --> 00:00:29,960
She closed her eyes.

11
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:32,840
She splashed the cold water on her face.

12
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:35,340
She felt ready for school.

13
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:38,220
She made herself a cup of coffee.

14
00:00:39,120 --> 00:00:40,700
She drank the whole thing.

15
00:00:41,620 --> 00:00:43,380
She felt awake.
